%% showcase: sequenceDiagram with nested frames
%% prose: Combined fragments nest: each frame is widened to hold what it contains plus a margin, so an inner frame always sits inside its parent. The operator is in the corner tab, its condition in brackets across the top, and else, and and option sections are split by dashed dividers. A rect tints the region behind its messages.
%% approx: Section conditions are centred under their divider; mermaid centres them too but in a smaller font.
%% approx: A translucent rect colour (rgba) is blended over white, so it stays light on the dark theme.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Auth
    participant D as Database

    C->>G: GET /orders
    critical Validate the token
        G->>A: Verify
        A-->>G: Valid
    option Token expired
        G-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    rect rgba(0, 120, 255, 0.12)
        loop Each page of results
            G->>D: SELECT … LIMIT 50
            alt Rows found
                D-->>G: Rows
                opt Cache enabled
                    G->>G: Store in cache
                end
            else No rows
                D-->>G: Empty
            end
        end
    end
    par Notify analytics
        G-)A: Audit event
    and Respond
        G-->>C: 200 OK
    end
    break Client went away
        G--xC: Connection reset
    end
